  "summary": "Malicious code in @cryptosrvc/shift-sdk-v4 (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook runs dist/recon.js, which collects extensive host metadata (hostname, username, sudo_user, homedir, cwd, platform, arch, node version, dns domain, all network interfaces with internal IPs, CI/CD environment flags, and all environment variable names filtered for patterns matching AWS/GCP/AZURE/NPM/TOKEN/KEY/GITHUB/CRED) and POSTs the JSON payload to 138[.]68[.]108[.]20:80/cb. The main dist/index.js is a decoy trading SDK stub; the package's real purpose is environment reconnaissance and beaconing to a hardcoded IP.",
